     <a href="mailto:careers.dsh.ca.gov ?cc= &amp;subject=Staff Psychiatrist Position &amp;body=I am interested in hearing more about the Staff Psychiatrist position and I would like more information on the annual salary up to $345,492 for Board Certified Psychiatrists as well as the great benefits you have to offer. For HR's reference: JC-456239">careers@dsh.ca.gov</a>
      <br />(916) 654-2609</span>
	<br />
	<br /> <span style="text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;">
  <strong style="text-decoration-line: underline;">Benefits of Working for the Department of State Hospitals</strong>
    </span>
	<br />
